      "content": "i get that it's risky, but i've done it before with just coffee and i was fine. i don't have time to wait for a doctor's appointment before my exams start next week. if i just take the caffeine pills a few hours after my ritalin so they aren't hitting at the exact same time, would that make it safer? i just really need to know if i can do this to get through the week.",
